msgid ""
"Don't let him get away!\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Press <Action:Button_R2@Chase> when chasing to dash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Running into a passerby when dashing will momentarily\r\n"
"stop your momentum. Avoid them at all costs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Button_Cross@Chase> to jump. You can jump over bicycles, "
"guard rails, garbage cans, and other low objects."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"The gauges at the bottom right represent your "
"<Color:7>stamina<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"<Color:7>Hit the runner while dashing<Color:Default>\r\n"
"to greatly reduce their stamina."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"When the runner's stamina reaches zero, press <Action:Button_Square@Chase> "
"to grab him."
msgstr ""

